{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53858","headline":"白芙蓉赋附歌 · 李德裕","name":"白芙蓉赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋水濶兮秋露浓，盛华落兮叹芙蓉。\n菖花紫兮君不识，萍实丹兮君不逢。\n想佳人兮密静处，颜如玉兮无冶容。\n（见《李卫公别集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}